{
  "id": "compressed_air___friction_loss_in_hoses",
  "title": "Compressed Air - Friction Loss in Hoses",
  "description": "Calculate friction loss in compressed air hoses based on pipe diameter, flow rate, pressure, and hose length",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "content": "Friction Loss Calculator for Compressed Air Hoses",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "pipe_diameter",
          "label": "Hose Diameter",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.75,
          "unit": "inches"
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure",
          "label": "Operating Pressure (Gauge)",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "50 psi",
              "value": 50
            },
            {
              "label": "70 psi",
              "value": 70
            },
            {
              "label": "90 psi",
              "value": 90
            },
            {
              "label": "110 psi",
              "value": 110
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": 90
        },
        {
          "id": "flow_rate",
          "label": "Air Flow Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 30,
          "unit": "cfm"
        },
        {
          "id": "hose_length",
          "label": "Hose Length",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 10,
          "unit": "feet"
        },
        {
          "id": "reference_length",
          "label": "Reference Length for Loss Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 50,
          "unit": "feet"
        },
        {
          "id": "reference_loss",
          "label": "Friction Loss at Reference Length",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.4,
          "unit": "psi"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "friction_loss",
          "label": "Friction Loss in Hose",
          "formula": "(inputs.reference_loss / inputs.reference_length) * inputs.hose_length",
          "unit": "psi",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "friction_loss_kpa",
          "label": "Friction Loss in Hose",
          "formula": "(inputs.reference_loss / inputs.reference_length) * inputs.hose_length * 6.9",
          "unit": "kPa",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "friction_loss_bar",
          "label": "Friction Loss in Hose",
          "formula": "(inputs.reference_loss / inputs.reference_length) * inputs.hose_length * 0.069",
          "unit": "bar",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "content": "Friction Loss vs Hose Length",
      "options": {
        "title": {
          "text": "Friction Loss in Compressed Air Hose"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "trigger": "axis"
        },
        "xAxis": {
          "type": "category",
          "name": "Hose Length (ft)",
          "data": [
            0,
            10,
            20,
            30,
            40,
            50,
            100,
            150,
            200
          ]
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "type": "value",
          "name": "Friction Loss (psi)"
        },
        "series": [
          {
            "name": "50 psi line",
            "type": "line",
            "data": [],
            "smooth": true,
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "70 psi line",
            "type": "line",
            "data": [],
            "smooth": true,
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#FF0000"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "90 psi line",
            "type": "line",
            "data": [],
            "smooth": true,
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#FFFF00"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "110 psi line",
            "type": "line",
            "data": [],
            "smooth": true,
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#0000FF"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Conversion Factors\n\n- 1 psig = 6.9 kPa = 0.069 bar\n- 1 inch = 25.4 mm\n- 1 ft (foot) = 0.3048 m\n- 1 scfm = 0.472 nl/s\n\n## Formula\n\nFriction Loss = (Reference Loss / Reference Length) × Hose Length\n\n## Example\n\nFor a 3/4\" hose with 90 psi pressure and 30 cfm flow rate:\n- Reference friction loss: 0.4 psi per 50 ft\n- For a 10 ft hose: (0.4 psi / 50 ft) × 10 ft = 0.08 psi"
    }
  ]
}